ions, social media storefronts, and marketplaces. It also provides Shopify Payments, a fully integrated payment processing service that allows merchants to accept and process payment cards online and offline. In addition, the company engages in the sale of themes and apps; shipping labels through Shopify Shipping; point-of-sale hardware; advertising on the Shopify App Store; and Shop Campaigns for buyer acquisitions, as well as registration of domain names. The company was formerly known as Jaded Pixel Technologies Inc. and changed its name to Shopify Inc. in November 2011. Shopify Inc. was incorporated in 2004 and is based in Ottawa, Canada.", "sector": "Technology", "industry": "Software - Application"}, "valuation": {"pe": 110.753525, "pb": 11.055169, "ps": 16.503489, "roe": 11.31, "net_margin": 10.77, "debt_to_equity": 1.432, "div_yield": null, "rev_growth": 34.3, "market_cap": 204082151424.0, "forward_pe": 48.27785, "peg": 2.1229, "payout": 0.0, "five_yr_yield": null, "pe_sector_med": 49.009563, "pb_sector_med": 7.295758, "roe_sector_med": 12.76, "div_yield_sector_med": 0.73}, "archetype": "growth", "archetype_label": "Growth", "archetype_label_zh": "\u6210\u957f\u80a1", "consensus": {"n_analysts": 4, "target_mean": 186.35638, "target_high": 246.51414, "target_low": 146.70615, "rating_mean": 1.76, "rating": "Buy", "rating_zh": "\u4e70\u5165", "upside_pct": 18.5}, "positioning": {"shares_short": 4887653.0, "days_to_cover": 1.98, "short_pct_float": 0.4, "held_insiders": 0.21, "held_institutions": 73.9}}, "earnings": {"next_date": "2026-08-05", "surprises": [{"date": "2026-05-05", "eps": -0.45, "est": 0.24, "surprise_pct": -289.2}, {"date": "2026-02-11", "eps": 0.48, "est": 0.51, "surprise_pct": -5.8}, {"date": "2025-11-04", "eps": 0.34, "est": 0.34, "surprise_pct": -0.6}, {"date": "2025-08-06", "eps": 0.35, "est": 0.29, "surprise_pct": 21.6}]}, "factor_beta": {"oil": 0.0, "gold": -0.67, "cad": 0.097, "r2": 0.37, "n": 504, "primary": "gold", "primary_label": "Gold